JioSaavn, a Songstress extension

A port of the Mornye Extension "jiosaavn" 1.0.8, which is
spotiflac-jiosaavn-extension
(https://github.com/HemanthJabalpuri/spotiflac-jiosaavn-extension), under the
MIT licence below, with the Mornye registry's compatibility fixes:

  Mornye Extension
  Copyright 2026 zarzet
  This product includes software developed by zarzet.
  SPDX-License-Identifier: LGPL-3.0-only

Ported to the Songstress extension SDK in 2026 by the Songstress authors:
the same JioSaavn requests and readings, its DES tables and block function
kept as written, rewritten in TypeScript as providers. The port is
LGPL-3.0-only as the registry's version it derives from; see LICENSE (the
GNU Lesser General Public License, version 3) and COPYING (the GNU General
Public License, version 3, which it builds on).

It runs on a Songstress server only, never in a phone's app.

